  "item": "GatewayMachine",
  "mu_name": "Gateway Machine",
  "mu_name_from": "NPC/to3gate.bmd, loaded as MODEL_KANTURU2ND_ENTER_NPC (ZzzOpenData.cpp:2034-2037), MuMain's MONSTER_GATEWAY_MACHINE, type 367 (_enum.h:4695; GM_Kanturu_2nd.cpp:106-113), the Relics' way into the Refinery Tower. OpenMU S6 KanturuRelics.cs:46 stands it at 141,191 facing South.",
